# Waking Dreams (windurst 93): 920's item options when the give fails. Accepted (GM) with the whisper (GM): option 3
# (Diabolos's Ring) with a full bag gives nothing, so the quest stays accepted and the whisper is kept; with room,
# option 4 (Diabolos's Torque) completes it. The repeat (a zone change, a day on, the whisper again): option 1
# (Diabolos's Pole) with a full bag gives nothing and keeps the whisper; option 2 (Diabolos's Earring) with room.
lists WindurstWaters/Kerutoto/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/920
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=13.0,-4.71,-155.9
quest Windurst.FoodForThought completed
quest Windurst.WakingDreams accepted
keyitem WhisperOfDreams
login
trigger Kerutoto                        # 920 (mask 32)
fill-inventory
finish option=3                         # no room for the ring: nothing, the whisper kept
free-inventory
trigger Kerutoto                        # 920 again
finish option=4                         # Diabolos's Torque; completed; the whisper taken; the date; mustZone
warp 22.0,-4.25,-155.6 WindurstWoods
warp 13.0,-4.71,-155.9 WindurstWaters   # the mustZone cleared
wait jst=1                              # past the lockout
keyitem WhisperOfDreams
trigger Kerutoto                        # completed, the whisper: 920 (repeat, mask 40: the torque held, no SMN)
fill-inventory
finish option=1                         # no room for the pole: nothing, the whisper kept
free-inventory
trigger Kerutoto                        # 920 again
finish option=2                         # Diabolos's Earring; the whisper taken; the date
